          <h3 style="margin:12px 0 0; font-size:25px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-.02em; color:#11161F;">Close the books in days, not weeks.</h3>
          <p style="margin:12px 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55; color:#48505F; max-width:440px;">AI invoice capture with 3-way match, automated expense audit, and an orchestrated month-end close that chases its own approvals.</p>
          <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0; margin:22px 0 0; display:grid; gap:11px;">
